An assignment acquisition and its implicit counterpart are both validated.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['^Holdings$'], denominate: true })

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Holdings
account Bank
account Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 100 USD
2024-01-01 Opening balance
  Holdings  = 2 FUND
  Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Holdings",
    "commodity": "USD",
    "quantity": "200"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Positive FUND posting must use a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}); the default commodity is USD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:11:3

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Negative FUND posting must use both a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}) and a transaction price (@ or @@); the default commodity is USD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:12:3

[NEGATIVE_POSTING_DATE_HOLDING] Opening: holding is -2 FUND on 2024-01-01 using posting dates; disposals must not precede available acquisitions
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:12:3
